    "detailed_description": "<h1>ANOTHER TINY ROOM STORIES</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are in Rift Escape.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670080/extras/c94f183b115de096f2e8098f18d1647f.poster.avif?t=1720845529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670080/extras/c94f183b115de096f2e8098f18d1647f.webm?t=1720845529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670080/extras/c94f183b115de096f2e8098f18d1647f.mp4?t=1720845529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Tiny Room Stories: Rift Escape it is a point and click adventure game with elements of the \u201cEscape the room\u201d mechanics.<br><br>The game world consists of isometric dioramas of different places, rooms, dungeons, etc. united by a common story. A key feature of the gameplay is the ability to rotate dioramas, thus changing the point of view, which allows you to see new places and objects.<br><br>The story begins with the disappearance of the protagonist's wife. You have to go in search of her, traveling through various space-time dimensions, solving various puzzles and riddles along the way, to find out the mystery of her disappearance.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670080/extras/c55d528fb9e556c9c7423653e0b8bfdc.poster.avif?t=1720845529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670080/extras/c55d528fb9e556c9c7423653e0b8bfdc.webm?t=1720845529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670080/extras/c55d528fb9e556c9c7423653e0b8bfdc.mp4?t=1720845529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br>All game it is a different locations from the fantasy to the sci-fi connected between with mystic story. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670080/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__2_.gif?t=1654059312?t=1720845529\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fully 3D levels that can and should be rotated to inspect them from another angle.<br></li><li> Variety of locations from the usual residential building to the ancient catacombs.<br></li><li> Variety of themes from the fantasy to the sci-fi<br></li><li> Interactive world<br></li><li> Many puzzles and riddles<br></li><li> Story, with unexpected plot twists.</li></ul>",
